  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIn-the-Wild: A Deepfake Detection Dataset\n\t\n\nWelcome to In-the-Wild, a dataset for evaluationg audio deepfake detection.It accompanies the paper: Does Audio Deepfake Detection Generalize?  arXiv:2203.16263\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nThe In-the-Wild dataset contains real and synthetic speech recordings of 58 celebrities and politicians, collected from online videos.\nIt provides a realistic benchmark for testing how well audio deepfake detection models generalize beyond\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/mueller91/In-The-Wild.",
